    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "How did you spend your life?",
      "uuid": "0b5c73b405f74774abd88cb81021b47b",
      "x": 936.8605003953003,
      "y": 2369.087722615079,
      "width": 298.8125,
      "height": 31.0,
      "z_value": -9.865000000000075,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "How did you spend your life?",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "Intentional",
      "uuid": "e55f37c1942640a0ace5fe5c860b4a03",
      "x": 5330.526627230138,
      "y": -2452.4520869851813,
      "width": 313.783682547785,
      "height": 173.8736450354091,
      "z_value": -9.989000000000006,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "It's a terrible name for a parable\nSince there are so many 1-2-3 rules in this world\nAnd it even uses base numbers for identifiers\nBut the message in it is solid\nAnd we named it this in a hurry\nSo we are sticking to it\nAnd just going to go with it"
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "Because the information has been converted to Three's local context",
      "uuid": "83975c3fb6784a57ac4694fbbd8b0aed",
      "x": 5120.593356684418,
      "y": 728.9028835272647,
      "width": 698.0,
      "height": 29.0,
      "z_value": -9.960000000000022,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": false,
      "label": "Because the information has been converted to Three's local context",
      "depth_front": false,
      "node_tint": ""
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "Kinetic",
      "uuid": "f690b1f76c9945a4ac41f7b8c04ba8a2",
      "x": 4940.369642701604,
      "y": -2133.326314847115,
      "width": 300.0,
      "height": 150.53458202160976,
      "z_value": -9.98300000000001,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "The One, in this case, being me\nNot first, just wrap your mind\nwith the mental image of a human\nAs a single object, out of context with anything else, 1x Human"
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "Onward",
      "uuid": "ab76ef01a6804cd5bd7d674d2d4ba9f1",
      "x": 5461.417356819182,
      "y": -391.4680595826462,
      "width": 304.7408703952204,
      "height": 148.1825688885001,
      "z_value": -9.969000000000017,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "With that all in mind\nLets also keep in mind\nThat One and Five\nAre default near identical traversing souls"
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "Sweet",
      "uuid": "5bebf7f8327b47dc822033f3a67298a0",
      "x": 5270.587937243916,
      "y": -1178.9152525278141,
      "width": 304.33896102795427,
      "height": 200.50267870725963,
      "z_value": -9.974000000000014,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "The premise here then isnt any of us, the one, the five, the three, or anyone else included in this mess that you have made\n\nThe premise here, is the two and the four\nWhich aren't humans, just needed to get\nThe mental image of two humans distanced\nAnd you between them, clearly across\nBefore I tell you this"
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "warm",
      "title": "Good",
      "uuid": "643912b0959941b18b5be29e25948c60",
      "x": 5268.559487060498,
      "y": 1305.357478441685,
      "width": 282.55159146239833,
      "height": 180.66700505307654,
      "z_value": -9.955000000000025,
      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "body_text": "The Five never received\nThe context of understanding from The One\n\nWhat five received\nwas the contextual abstraction\nThat The Three needed\nTo make sense of it in the first place\nIn it's own context"
    },
    {
      "node_id": 0,
      "node_type": "about",
      "title": "The Tale of The Sun's Love",
      "uuid": "32ead154f64c47aa81c3762a2395d7b0",
